<m>R = \{(r,\theta): 1 \le r \le 2,\ 0\le\theta\le\tfrac{\pi}{2}\}</m>
is divided into finer and finer polar rectangles; a highlighted cell
has area exactly <m>r^*\,\Delta r\,\Delta\theta</m>, and the sum
<m>\sum r^*\,\Delta r\,\Delta\theta</m> equals the area
<m>\tfrac{3\pi}{4}</m> of <m>R</m> at every stage.
</caption>
